MSstats supports for the labeled-based SRM experiments (light and heavy peptides). And MSstatsTMT supports for iTRAQ and TMT experiments. You can use MSstatsTMT to analyze SILAC data but you may need to change the format of the data file to apply MSstatsTMT.  Can you show the first 10 rows of your psm file?

